<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Datatec details 2,9-million cash unit issue.</title>
<headline>Datatec details 2,9-million cash unit issue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African electronics firm Datatec Ltd said on Monday it had issued 400,000 combined units to Rand Merchant Bank Ltd at 1.150 cents a unit on October 28.</p>
<p>In addition, the group said it had issued 2,5-million combined units to funds managed by Old Mutual Asset Managers at 1.500 cents a unit on January 31.</p>
<p>The listing of the units had been approved by the Johannesburg Stock Exchange, Datatec said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
